        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b18bfecf-c829-39bc-8d44-03655fa09c39",
                "word": "impérialiste",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fef5e147-48e9-40b7-9720-8696f53ce50f",
                        "entry_id": "b18bfecf-c829-39bc-8d44-03655fa09c39",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "impérialistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "45cd20dd-3188-385c-b266-12cc1d5fa6fa",
                        "entry_id": "b18bfecf-c829-39bc-8d44-03655fa09c39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif aux idées, aux sentiments de l’impérialisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "410e1341-866f-44d8-8059-5dc9a6c5f1a7",
                                "sense_id": "45cd20dd-3188-385c-b266-12cc1d5fa6fa",
                                "text": "De toutes les productions de l’imagination humaine, qui rendaient merveilleux le monde confus dans lequel vivait M. Bert Smallways, aucune était aussi étrange, aussi aveugle, aussi inquiétante, aussi fanatique, aussi bruyante, aussi dangereuse que la modernisation du patriotisme, amenée par la politique impérialiste et internationaliste."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "023bb49d-f549-4f2e-95d9-35ef4b36c4c0",
                                "sense_id": "45cd20dd-3188-385c-b266-12cc1d5fa6fa",
                                "text": "La ploutocratie chilienne s’était appuyée sur deux forces : les milieux réactionnaires de la Marine et les intérêts impérialistes britanniques."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc7a34e8-654a-31b1-ab88-482cc5ab14a7",
                        "entry_id": "b18bfecf-c829-39bc-8d44-03655fa09c39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Partisan du régime politique impérial."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bcd9790-8281-400e-a62d-07a928c55785",
                                "sense_id": "bc7a34e8-654a-31b1-ab88-482cc5ab14a7",
                                "text": "Par ces deux dates s'explique la publication de ce volume, destiné à éclairer le vote des électeurs. Soit qu'ils donnent, soit qu'ils refusent leur suffrage à un candidat impérialiste, il importe qu'ils sachent ce qu'ils font."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d115b99-4360-421a-9618-c8419d88cd91",
                                "sense_id": "bc7a34e8-654a-31b1-ab88-482cc5ab14a7",
                                "text": "C'était une élection toute politique. M. d'Haussonville passa au premier tour de scrutin, au nez et à la barbe du parti impérialiste, qui n'avait trouvé personne à lui opposer."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cfd02cbd-5cac-4f69-97c3-937a81fbf568",
                        "source_entry_id": "b18bfecf-c829-39bc-8d44-03655fa09c39",
                        "target_lang_word": "imperialistisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imperialistisch",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b306733-fc77-3dde-9652-38aab0986f66",
                                        "entry_id": "211be8a5-ffe4-349a-b1ab-69a6fa576306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "auf dem Imperialismus beruhend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1732bbc-da95-45c9-afd0-ee83bf49360f",
                                                "sense_id": "5b306733-fc77-3dde-9652-38aab0986f66",
                                                "text": "Manche Staaten gebärden sich immer noch imperialistisch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d35a558-30b5-4192-a7c2-dfb7d0de553d",
                                                "sense_id": "5b306733-fc77-3dde-9652-38aab0986f66",
                                                "text": "„Tatsächlich ordnet sich der gegen Philipp V. ausgebrochene 2. Römisch-Makedonische Krieg in eine lange Reihe imperialistischer Übergriffe ein, die so alt waren wie die Errichtung der römischen Hegemonie über Italien.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "266b2df5-e499-4337-b2c0-98103a85c1b1",
                                                "sense_id": "5b306733-fc77-3dde-9652-38aab0986f66",
                                                "text": "„Vielmehr entlud sich 1857 die geballte Unzufriedenheit der Einheimischen gegen das immer aggressivere imperialistische Gebaren der Briten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3662ab6c-2e89-4168-8cb4-4cb7c402b126",
                                                "sense_id": "5b306733-fc77-3dde-9652-38aab0986f66",
                                                "text": "„Wir leben in einer Epoche der neuen Blockbildung alter imperialistischer Zentren: China, Russland, die USA, Europa.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "01239448-9333-4473-bec2-ef05f59edc4c",
                        "source_entry_id": "b18bfecf-c829-39bc-8d44-03655fa09c39",
                        "target_lang_word": "imperialist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imperialist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c0bb910-381b-31f4-aa1c-ff81d360cbd9",
                                        "entry_id": "fa1414f8-37ff-3da6-861f-3d65785923d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, or relating to imperialism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bd1e68e-d9e5-4992-8112-1bf1952680d0",
                                                "sense_id": "1c0bb910-381b-31f4-aa1c-ff81d360cbd9",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, the nationalitarian phenomenon is one in which the struggle against the imperialist powers of occupation has as its object, beyond the clearing of the national territory, the independence and sovereignty of the national State, uprooting in depth the positions of the ex-colonial power— the reconquest of the power of decision in all domains of national life, the prelude to that reconquest of identity which is at the heart of the renaissance undertaken on the basis of fundamental national demands, and ceaselessly contested, by every means available, on every level, and notably on the internal level'."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "imperialist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44e567d8-52b7-3ef3-bc70-e6bbd6f68d8f",
                                        "entry_id": "53ba75e3-99e4-38ca-a687-032483974e1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advocate of imperialism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6836b0b-a473-482e-a5e3-6063b37f53d7",
                                                "sense_id": "44e567d8-52b7-3ef3-bc70-e6bbd6f68d8f",
                                                "text": "\"The Japanese imperialists enforced the harshest colonial rule in history over Korea, bringing unspeakably horrible misfortune and sufferings and disasters to the Korean nation,\" said a spokesman for the Central Committee of the Democratic Front for the Reunification of Korea, according to the state-run Korean Central News Agency."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba29c266-8bd8-41bc-8d6b-bf46c52f651b",
